<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Conservative Party (Brazil)</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Conservative Party was one of the two main political parties of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/brazilian-empire">Brazilian Empire</a>, alongside the Liberal Party. It favoured a strong central government and the monarchy. Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pedro-ii-of-brazil">Pedro II</a> regularly alternated power between the two parties, appointing ministries according to his own assessment of political conditions.</p></div>
